          "nightswatch"
        ],
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
          "soldier",
          "wanderer",
          "scholar"
        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "守夜人兄弟爱拿艾迪的悲观取乐，却也习惯在最糟时听见他的声音。一个能在冻尸旁说冷笑话、说完仍把该做的活做完的人，比许多满口勇气却临阵逃跑的人可靠。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": [
          "vale"
        ],
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
          "lord",
          "notable"
        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "谷地贵族若记得托勒特家，会把艾迪看作放弃继承道路的旁支子弟。到了长城，家世只能让人多受几句嘲讽；能否赢得尊重，最终取决于他是否与别人一起挨饿守夜。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": [
          "nightswatch"
        ],
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
          "peasant",
          "artisan",
          "sailor"
        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "普通黑衣兄弟觉得艾迪像一场不会停的阴雨，可他的抱怨很少妨碍职责。有人甚至相信，只要艾迪还在预言更坏的结局，真正的末日就暂时没来。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
